@host = http://localhost:8080

###------------ MAIN SCENARIO------------ ###


###------------ HEALTH------------ ###

# @name health
GET http://localhost:8080/health

###

# @name healthDb
GET http://localhost:8080/health/db

###--------------------------------------- ###

### ---------------------------------------
### REGISTER ADMIN
### do not forget to remove default admin from the database
### ---------------------------------------

###
# @name registerAdmin
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

