GET {{host}}/me/results
Authorization: Bearer {{user2Token}}

###
# @name adminTickets
GET {{host}}/me/results
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### ---------------------------------------
### MANUAL STEP
### ---------------------------------------
### Before the next request, move draw {{drawId}} to CLOSED
### through DB or wait for scheduler.

### ---------------------------------------
### RUN DRAW
### ---------------------------------------

# @name runDraw
POST {{host}}/admin/draws/{{drawId}}/run-draw
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ---------------------------------------

# @name runDraw2
POST {{host}}/admin/draws/{{draw2Id}}/run-draw
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

